<title>USA: Transitional to consider Vencor offer.</title>
<headline>Transitional to consider Vencor offer.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transitional Hospitals Corp said Wednesday it would hold a board meeting withing the next several days to consider Vencor Inc's $16 per share offer.</p>
<p>&quot;Our focus from the start has been to do what we can to maximize value for our shareholders,&quot; Transitional Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Richard Conte said in a statement. &quot;We remain committed to achieving that goal.&quot;</p>
</text>
